yle=\"margin: 0px;\">Izitshalo ziyolahlekelwa amanzi angaba ngu-3.2mm namuhla — nisela cishe lokho uma kungekho mvula</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-snug text-[var(--text-muted)]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span>Unreviewed isiZulu draft. </span><span lang=\"en\">English source: Crops will lose about 3.2mm of water today — water roughly that much if there's no rain</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"flex overflow-x-auto\" style=\"scrollbar-width: none;\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 px-2 py-2\" style=\"min-width: 58px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\"><div class=\"font-sans font-medium\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);\">Namuhla</div><img src=\"/element-art-2/weather_partly_cloudy.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 23px; height: 23px; margin: 1px 0px;\"><div class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-primary);\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">23°</span><span style=\"color: var(--text-muted);\"> -1°</span></div><div class=\"font-sans\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"sr-only\" lang=\"zu\">Ayikho imvula</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 px-2 py-2\" style=\"min-width: 58px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\"><div class=\"font-sans font-medium\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);\">Mso</div><img src=\"/element-art-2/weather_clear.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 23px; height: 23px; margin: 1px 0px;\"><div class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-primary);\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">38°</span><span style=\"color: var(--text-muted);\"> 12°</span></div><div class=\"font-sans\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"sr-only\" lang=\"zu\">Ayikho imvula</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 px-2 py-2\" style=\"min-width: 58px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\"><div class=\"font-sans font-medium\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);\">Bil</div><img src=\"/element-art-2/weather_thunderstorm.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 23px; height: 23px; margin: 1px 0px;\"><div class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-primary);\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">23°</span><span style=\"color: var(--text-muted);\"> 12°</span></div><div class=\"font-sans\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--blue); margin-top: 2px;\">30mm · 80%</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 px-2 py-2\" style=\"min-width: 58px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\"><div class=\"font-sans font-medium\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);\">Tha</div><img src=\"/element-art-2/weather_fog.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 23px; height: 23px; margin: 1px 0px;\"><div class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-primary);\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">23°</span><span style=\"color: var(--text-muted);\"> 12°</span></div><div class=\"font-sans\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"sr-only\" lang=\"zu\">Ayikho imvula</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 px-2 py-2\" style=\"min-width: 58px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\"><div class=\"font-sans font-medium\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);\">Sin</div><img src=\"/element-art-2/weather_snow.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 23px; height: 23px; margin: 1px 0px;\"><div class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-primary);\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">23°</span><span style=\"color: var(--text-muted);\"> 12°</span></div><div class=\"font-sans\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px